,"featuredImage":13,"publishedDate":31,"slices":32},"Introducing the Evri Group: The UK’s Premier Parcel Delivery Company",null,"Read here about the Evri Group: the UK’s Premier Parcel Delivery Company","introducing-the-evri-group-the-uks-premier-parcel-delivery-company.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fintroducing-the-evri-group-the-uks-premier-parcel-delivery-company","Introducing the Evri Group: the UK’s Premier Parcel Delivery Company",{"dimensions":14,"alt":17,"copyright":9,"url":18,"id":19,"edit":20,"thumbnail":24},{"width":15,"height":16},960,526,"A photo of Martijn de Lange, the CEO of Evri Group","introducing-the-evri-group-the-uks-premier-parcel-delivery-company.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaNzol55xUNkB1Uzb_MartijndeLangeEvriGroup.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1759,964&w=960&h=526","aNzol55xUNkB1Uzb",{"x":21,"y":21,"zoom":22,"background":23},0,1,"transparent",{"dimensions":25,"alt":17,"copyright":9,"url":28,"id":19,"edit":29},{"width":26,"height":27},384,182,"introducing-the-evri-group-the-uks-premier-parcel-delivery-company.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaNzol55xUNkB1Uzb_MartijndeLangeEvriGroup.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,65,1759,834&w=384&h=182",{"x":21,"y":30,"zoom":22,"background":23},65,"2025-10-01",[33,118],{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":36,"primary":38,"id":116,"slice_type":117,"slice_label":9},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[37],{},{"content":39},[40,48,51,54,57,60,63,66,70,73,76,79,82,85,88,91,94,97,100,103,105],{"type":41,"text":42,"spans":43,"direction":47},"paragraph","A message from Martijn de Lange, CEO Evri Group",[44],{"start":21,"end":45,"type":46},47,"strong","ltr",{"type":41,"text":49,"spans":50,"direction":47},"",[],{"type":41,"text":52,"spans":53,"direction":47},"On 1 October 2025, we officially completed our merger with DHL eCommerce UK.",[],{"type":41,"text":55,"spans":56,"direction":47},"This is a pivotal moment in our history as we bring together two highly complementary businesses to create the UK’s premier parcel delivery group.",[],{"type":41,"text":58,"spans":59,"direction":47},"The enlarged Evri Group brings exciting benefits, opportunities and choice for consumers, clients, suppliers and our people as we become a one-stop solution for domestic and international parcel logistics.",[],{"type":41,"text":61,"spans":62,"direction":47},"Bringing combined experience of over 60 years in logistics, Evri’s flexible, effective and unique self-employed courier proposition, will be enhanced with the addition of DHL eCommerce’s UK network. Next year, DHL eCommerce UK will be rebranded and go by the name Evri Premium – a Network of DHL, it will remain a separate network offering fast, time-sensitive deliveries with enhanced shipping security protection for high-value and large items.",[],{"type":41,"text":64,"spans":65,"direction":47},"The new Evri Group will include:",[],{"type":67,"text":68,"spans":69,"direction":47},"list-item","Evri’s core offer of a flexible courier network for low-weight and low-value parcels.",[],{"type":67,"text":71,"spans":72,"direction":47},"A dedicated and secure premium van network for high value items called Evri Premium.",[],{"type":67,"text":74,"spans":75,"direction":47},"Business-to-business (B2B) parcel services.",[],{"type":67,"text":77,"spans":78,"direction":47},"Unrivalled international capability and customs clearance expertise.",[],{"type":67,"text":80,"spans":81,"direction":47},"Fulfilment services to handle the behind-the-scenes process of storing products, packing them, shipping them, and making sure they arrive on time.",[],{"type":67,"text":83,"spans":84,"direction":47},"A best-in-class business mail service – UK Mail.",[],{"type":41,"text":86,"spans":87,"direction":47},"Our combined group will bring together a team of over 30,000 couriers and van drivers, 12,000 colleagues, with a fleet of 8,000 vehicles to deliver over 1 billion parcels and 1 billion letters annually.",[],{"type":41,"text":89,"spans":90,"direction":47},"Our incredible people will remain the driving force behind this UK success story, coming together to offer the best possible service and choice as we journey towards becoming the UK’s most competitive, customer-focused parcel carrier.",[],{"type":41,"text":92,"spans":93,"direction":47},"We are extremely excited for what the future holds.",[],{"type":41,"text":95,"spans":96,"direction":47},"Martijn de Lange",[],{"type":41,"text":98,"spans":99,"direction":47},"CEO",[],{"type":41,"text":101,"spans":102,"direction":47},"Evri Group",[],{"type":41,"text":49,"spans":104,"direction":47},[],{"type":41,"text":106,"spans":107,"direction":47},"Watch the video here",[108,115],{"start":21,"end":109,"type":110,"data":111},20,"hyperlink",{"link_type":112,"url":113,"target":114},"Web","introducing-the-evri-group-the-uks-premier-parcel-delivery-company.html\u002F\u002Fvimeo.com\u002F1122801182\u002F0c6815b5dd","_blank",{"start":21,"end":109,"type":46},"rich_text$3e17074e-984c-431f-af68-ac47b28f726f","rich_text",{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":119,"primary":120,"id":161,"slice_type":117,"slice_label":9},[],{"content":121},[122,127,132,140,144,149,152,155,158],{"type":41,"text":123,"spans":124,"direction":47},"Notes to Editors",[125],{"start":21,"end":126,"type":46},16,{"type":41,"text":128,"spans":129,"direction":47},"Media enquiries  ",[130],{"start":21,"end":131,"type":46},17,{"type":41,"text":133,"spans":134,"direction":47},"For any enquiries relating to Evri Group or its companies; Evri, DHL eCommerce UK, UK Mail and Coll-8, please contact: prteam@evri.com",[135],{"start":136,"end":137,"type":110,"data":138},119,134,{"link_type":112,"url":139,"target":114},"mailto:prteam@evri.com",{"type":41,"text":141,"spans":142,"direction":47}," ",[143],{"start":21,"end":22,"type":46},{"type":41,"text":145,"spans":146,"direction":47},"About Evri  ",[147],{"start":21,"end":148,"type":46},12,{"type":41,"text":150,"spans":151,"direction":47},"Evri Group brings together Evri, DHL eCommerce UK – which in 2026 will be rebranded Evri Premium, a network of DHL - customs clearance and logistics specialist Coll-8 and business letters leader UK Mail, to create the UK’s premier parcel delivery company. The combined Evri Group will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually",[],{"type":41,"text":153,"spans":154,"direction":47},"Evri, the core operating brand, currently delivers around 900 million parcels a year, and is on a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth.",[],{"type":41,"text":156,"spans":157,"direction":47},"Working with everyone from Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites to gift-givers, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the last five decades and now has a team of 12,000+ employees and 30,000 couriers, as well as a growing network of more than 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and 500+ state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialist, and merger with DHL eCommerce UK, Evri Group continues to enhance its international capability and enable world trade.",[],{"type":41,"text":159,"spans":160,"direction":47},"Evri has close to 4 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.6\u002F5, reflecting a strong commitment to customer experience.",[],"rich_text$d943dff3-8312-4cc6-8352-5ee66c413f35","2025-10-01T15:04:49+0000",["Reactive",164],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":165,"$sclients":233,"$sglobal-basket-count":9},{"abtasty":166,"accessibe":170,"appPromoBanner":173,"autoDivertUpdates":177,"awin":180,"bulkInternational":183,"bulkSendEnabled":186,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":189,"enableBasketCount":192,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":195,"euCustomsDuty":198,"groovyAdvert":201,"newInternationalSendFlow":204,"newinternationalpages":211,"oohPrefer